  "translate_en|mods/JeevesZones/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox_EN.txt|Sandbox_JZ_CorpseRecovery_tooltip": "ON (default): a player who dies inside a protected zone can loot their own corpse and pick their dropped weapon off the ground, even where container access is blocked. Zombie corpses stay locked, so luring a horde in for the trader guards to kill and looting the pile still does not work. OFF: the old behaviour -- nothing inside a no-container-access zone can be looted, including your own death loot.",
